{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_ascln_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ascln_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "同行人",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ascln_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eb166b0d097432b475a6e0be44ef06016aa82d8ef3559d3b14c30004a67c9e01",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1072年秋"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刺客從陰影中躍出，一柄斷劍幾乎是貼著特雷西斯的前胸掠過。他側身，出手，佩劍已經橫在了刺客的脖頸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "日影剛好在此時完全傾斜過來，將街道遮住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你一直在等待這一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣確實能最大化發揮你的優勢，隱藏身形，接近敵人。但在晝夜交替的特殊時刻，你的敵人對環境變化的感知也會更敏感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "整個下午，我一共出手了七次，但一次都沒能得手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換一個對手，你早就成功了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你割斷了我胸前的綁帶……用這柄曾經被我斬斷的長劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天就到這裡，明天再繼續。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨天，兩個喝醉的傭兵闖進了我們的辦公地點，他們扔下了一個酒壺，裡面是活性化的源石粉塵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當時，殿下正在大廳為兩個孩子包紮傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不是意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經知道，我已經處理過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "類似的事情，越來越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "軍事委員會……你保護不了殿下和巴別塔？你是真的沒有辦法，還是在縱容他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這件事，不需要你來質問我，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼對薩卡茲更好，我比你更清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，老師……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果真有人對殿下動手，你會出手嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那如果其他人都架著你，逼你對她動手，你會出手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉默。\n但兩人的心中各自都有了答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是最後一堂課了，老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有想通……但從明天起，我會去殿下身邊，守護好她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "連帶著你本應有的心意一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸不再言語，她彎腰撿起剛被特雷西斯打落的斷劍，以及散落在一旁，被她視作戰利品的斷裂綁帶。\n她頭也不回地離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你選擇的只是某個人，而不是那個人腳下的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道為何而行，那麼你要如何承受失去同行人的痛苦，阿斯卡綸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1094年秋\n卡茲戴爾北部地區"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "炸藥已經填放好。接下來我就守在這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "土方子、早霜，船上還有好幾個跟我一樣熟悉航路的人，如果發現異樣，他們會在第一時間讓羅德島轉向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只剩下一個小時了，我得守在這裡，保證炸藥能在羅德島經過這片區域的時候被觸發——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你放在外圍的人都已經死了，細鹽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，還是被你找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是，我的武藝和潛行的技術都是你教的，期望躲過你，不切實際。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，以前我就好奇，不管藏得多好，都能被你找到，你到底是靠什麼精準定位到每個人的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "味道？聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……總不能是靠哈出來的氣吧，這在你看來也是某種“煙”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*，還真是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就沒辦法了，我總不能不呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然都被你發現了，介意我生堆火嗎？入秋了，這荒郊野嶺的，冷得很！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲生起了火，風有點大，他用劍撥了撥火堆，火勢才起來，嗶剝聲變大了，聲音遠遠地傳開去。\n阿斯卡綸沒有動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些烈性源石炸藥，製作得很粗糙……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情報到手得有點遲，做得太倉促了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年離開卡茲戴爾的時候，我萬萬沒想到，先是需要跟你學潛行和動刀子，後來又得學做炸藥，和這些我最討厭的石頭打交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說真的，這比把野生鹽泉旁邊的那些粗鹽粒提煉成可以吃的細鹽可難多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，當時缺帽簷“細鹽”“細鹽”地叫我的時候，就應該直接給他一拳讓他閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個代號太嬌貴了，一聽就是吃不了苦的……我好心讓大傢伙在荒野上執行任務的時候能吃得好點，結果還被取笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……誰知道後來你也跟著這麼叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "順口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……從這些炸藥的體積來看，爆炸範圍足以覆蓋好幾公里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了逼停羅德島，你不惜讓這整片區域都受到不可逆的污染？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不應該做這樣的事，也不應該是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "細鹽，你的任務是清洗那些叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下遇刺的時候，我們在那個小鎮上阻擊那些傭兵，我們用最快的速度趕回來……還來得及做的也只有跟你一起清洗那些叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "參與了那場刺殺的巴別塔成員，早就被你、被我們殺光了。十幾，幾十，還是上百？我忘了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些不屑於你們現在所做的事的人，已經不會再願意回到羅德島……包括我，我成了他們的一分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“叛徒”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，到底誰才是叛徒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，你應該和那個叫凱爾希的菲林保持聯繫，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道你沒聽說嗎，他們不會再嘗試回到卡茲戴爾，更不會去為特蕾西婭殿下復仇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才三個月，殿下死後才短短三個月，他們甚至已經在打算徹底丟掉“巴別塔”這個名字……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今那艘船還剩下多少薩卡茲？上百？幾十？還是十幾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不關心那艘船和那艘船上的人是不是將來不會再和我們有聯繫，但我們必須拿回屬於薩卡茲、屬於卡茲戴爾的東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個總待在特蕾西婭殿下身邊的小卡特斯，那個新的魔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲佣兵看着阿斯卡綸消失在原地，等他反應過來的時候，對方的袖刃已經深深刺進自己的身體，鮮血沁過胸前的布甲。\n下一個瞬間，銳利的疼痛才追上他。他跪倒在地，差點將火堆撲滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們的目標是阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這件事，殿下自有她的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個詞，你不該想，也不該提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕——咳，咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年，咳，離開卡茲戴爾，我是在你們的隊伍……快消失的時候才，決定追上你們……我連行李都沒帶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想要的，和殿下在做的事情差不多……讓大家的日子能，過得更好一些……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，我知道殿下的目標，殿下要走的路肯定比我想的要複雜很多……但她走在隊伍的前面，我們就，不用去想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但現在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，咳，你是離殿下最近的人……你不應該阻止我們，你是最不應該阻止我們的人，應該是你帶領我們去這麼做……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一口氣說了太多的話，薩卡茲劇烈地咳嗽起來，血從喉嚨深處湧上來，他的身體止不住地前傾，袖刃被更深地送進胸腔。\n但阿斯卡綸只是俯身看著他。\n或許是火堆快滅了，林子裡太暗了吧，他總覺得阿斯卡綸的眼睛裡有太多陰影，什麼都看不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，殿下死後，你真的跟其他人說的那樣，咳咳，已經沒有方向了，已經瘋了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後的時間，告訴我，阿米婭的事情，還有多少人知情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳，已經遲了，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我死了，你也阻止不了這場行動……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你剛剛的通訊對象，不是外圍那些被我殺死的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有另一隊也在進行同樣的行動……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在這裡，就是為了吸引我的注意力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你只有一個人，你沒有辦法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "翻湧的血塊和最後的話都被堵在了喉頭，薩卡茲看見薄幕般的煙霧像是不受控制一般從阿斯卡綸的身體逸出。\n那些煙霧像是活物，撲滅了火堆，很快就融進了幽深的夜色裡。\n透過胸口的袖刃，他感受到了阿斯卡綸的手在顫抖，她的身體像是忽然之間發生了某種“坍塌”，止不住地顫抖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "細鹽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "生命的最後，薩卡茲在這個他已經熟識多年的刺客臉上，看見了他從未見過的，痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你終於回來了，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "離這裡三十公里的兩片雷區，Ace他們正在帶人清除，羅德島暫時會停泊在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那兩夥人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一百三十四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱爾希低頭，接過阿斯卡綸遞來的東西。\n那是一疊布條，無一例外地別著巴別塔的袖標，它們有的已不完整，有的被血染透，黏膩得根本看不出本來的顏色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "參與了那場刺殺的叛徒，還有那些不該知道阿米婭身分的人，已經全部清除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你受傷得很重，晚一些需要到醫療部接受全面的檢查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你的源石技藝幾乎是在自傷，以你目前的情緒狀態，我不建議你接下來繼續深度使用它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來你打算怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你召回了我。這些問題，應該我問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特蕾西婭殿下的屍體？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與暗殺發生幾乎同時，羅德島附近的荒原上出現了赦罪師的身影，這兩件事情必然存在關聯。羅德島不會放棄追查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特雷西斯，羅德島以後怎麼看待他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島已不再是薩卡茲流亡政府，我們也不具備和軍事委員會正面對抗的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礦石病將是今後羅德島需要處理的主要問題。至於特雷西斯……將是我，你，我們這些少數人需要面對的問題，或心結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你對博士仍有懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僅從結果來看，特蕾西婭確實選擇在最後關頭以她的方式保護了博士。現階段，將博士送往烏薩斯，是最合適的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，看來你暫時沒有問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "選擇在此時將你召回，是因為羅德島需要組成一個完全獨立運作的機密組織，我叫它“S.W.E.E.P.”——“特別清除協議”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這件事應該由你來負責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“S.W.E.E.P.”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "S.W.E.E.P.要做兩件事：阻止針對羅德島的滲透、暗殺和破壞；執行隱秘行動，用上述方式解決問題，和以前一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和以前一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我並沒有守護好殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你希望我留下來，做我沒有做到的事情，你希望我為殿下的死贖罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，阿斯卡綸，這不是贖罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巴別塔已經不復存在，但仍有無數雙眼睛盯著我們，這艘船仍然舉步維艱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛剛過去的事情，絕不能在羅德島再發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你曾經是特雷西斯的學徒，巴別塔的反情報專家，沒有人比你更適合這份工作，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，你不會是一個人，你也不能是一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我希望由你擔任S.W.E.E.P.的主管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不必馬上回答，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在給我任何回覆之前，我有一個請求：去見阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "殘陽如血。\n她們最後的對話在肆意揚起的風沙中被掩去。\n“這段時間我一直待在她身邊，阿米婭已經適應了身體的變化……也不再哭了。”\n“阿斯卡綸，去見見她。或許你能明白，為什麼特蕾西婭最後會選擇她……特蕾西婭的道路並未終結。”\n“或許到時候，你會重新找到歸屬感，你的袖刃會為了一個更明確的目標而存在。”\n“……”\n“好。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
